bench/real/PARITE-RTK.md reproduces command names, option names and help
text from the reference RTK binary to document interoperability and gaps.
Descriptions and inventory annotations were added for LM Resizer.
No RTK filtering implementation was copied for the lossless views added
in this branch. The source is cited next to the inventory and benchmarks.

