The non-filter administration and agent integrations reference the public CLI
and host protocol conventions in RTK v0.50.0 at the same pinned commit above,
notably src/hooks/init.rs, src/hooks/hook_cmd.rs and src/analytics/gain.rs.
The new Rust modules and host adapters were independently implemented; no RTK
filtering source was imported. Protocol field names and interoperable command
names are retained where needed.
